	(descr "Amass XT60PW-M (XT60PW-M30.G.Y.T) horizontal PCB male connector, 35 A 80 V DC. Copy of the KiCad AMASS_XT60PW-M footprint with holes per the Amass product specification 2025V0: contacts 2.90 +0.10/0 mm -> 3.00 mm finished, pegs 0.80x1.90 +0.10/0 mm -> 0.90x2.00 mm plated slots (upper end of the tolerance so the fab drill tolerance cannot undersize them). Body 15.50 wide, 18.20 long: mating face 16.35 mm from the contact row, rear 1.80 mm behind it; place the mating face at the board edge. Pin 1/2 polarity marks copied from KiCad, verify against the moulded marks.")
